messages[10]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hey Anita, it's Kunal. I just wanted to double‑check—uh—what's the exact status of my home policy right now?
  user_2,Hi Kunal, yeah, the policy is still in Pending because we’re waiting on the signed declaration and your valuation report.
  user_1,Got it. I'm planning to email both tomorrow morning. Is there any specific file naming convention you need?
  user_2,Just make sure it's a single PDF, something like 'Kunal_Mehta_HomeValuation.pdf'—that works fine.
  user_1,Okay, and the $850 premium—I'll do a bank transfer today. Can you resend the account details?
  user_2,Sure, I'll send you an email right after this call with the bank details and a quick checklist. Anything else? [typing]
  user_1,Um, do I need to include a cover page or anything with the valuation?
  user_2,No cover page needed, just the valuation report and the signed declaration form attached together—[typing]—and the PDF should be under 5 MB.
  user_1,Great, thanks. Once you get the docs, will the policy go active immediately?
  user_2,As soon as we verify everything, we'll change the status to Active, usually within a couple of hours. I'll keep you posted.